Assets used by the worker probe (tools/probe/render.py). None are committed --
the script downloads or expects them in an --assets directory outside the repo.

Human
  "Worker", by Quaternius
  CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication)
  https://poly.pizza/m/Yg2bQZO6Hj
  https://static.poly.pizza/3a5f3056-ffe6-42eb-bd52-122afcbd22b2.glb
  Rigged, skinned, 24 baked animations, hard hat and hi-vis vest as separate
  materials. Stylised low-poly rather than photoreal, and flat-coloured rather
  than image-textured -- worth stating plainly, because it makes the result a
  lower bound on what a scanned human would score.

